'''The Last Resort''' was a [[Cantina|bar]] on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. [[Asajj Ventress]] and [[Quinlan Vos]], who was operating undercover, traveled to The Last Resort when they were hired to retrieve [[Pyke Syndicate]] boss [[Marg Krim]]'s family, who were being held hostage on Mustafar by [[Black Sun]].<ref name="Dark Disciple" />

